1. Added import for QueryNormalizerProvider
2. Added import for useQueryClient from @tanstack/react-query
3. Retrieved the queryClient instance using useQueryClient hook
4. Wrapped the component with QueryNormalizerProvider and passed the queryClient

This should resolve the error about the missing QueryNormalizer. The component hierarchy now provides both the ScopeProvider and QueryNormalizerProvider contexts that PostView needs.

Remember that we're keeping the actual PostView component implementation unchanged and just providing the necessary context wrappers to make it work in the preview environment. If you encounter any additional errors after this change, please let me know and I'll help resolve those as well.

